I'm afraid you must have had a !oHallu, or someone has altered the
source to include this message.  There is no instance of a message
similar to this in the src, dat, doc, util, sys or include directories
which make up the nethack sources.

In fact, the only instances of the word rabbit are in dat/data.base
and src/do_name.c.  In the former, the entry for rock is an excerpt
from The Hobbit wherein it says that rocks are good for hunting, among
other animals, rabbits.  In the latter, white rabbit and samurai
rabbit are two of the hallucinatory monsters you can run into.

